---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import sunsetBeach from "@/assets/sunset-beach.png";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description:
		"Learn about Yasir Shariff's work in Rust, blockchain infrastructure, distributed systems, and independent software products.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<div class="space-y-6">
		<h1 class="title">About</h1>
		<div class="flex justify-center">
			<Image
				alt="A beautiful sunset at the beach"
				fetchpriority="high"
				loading="eager"
				src={sunsetBeach}
			/>
		</div>
		<p class="text-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">
			I'm a software engineer based in Nairobi, Kenya. At IOTA, I lead work on notarization, audit
			trails, and proof of inclusion. That includes Rust infrastructure for constructing and
			verifying proofs, plus libraries, command-line tools, and WebAssembly and TypeScript APIs for
			developers.
		</p>
		<p class="text-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">
			My earlier work includes an Ethereum-compatible execution client at Bitfinity Network and
			backend services at LaunchAI. I also designed low-latency Solana RPC infrastructure for
			Tideblock. Through Shariff Consultancy, I build and operate Shipzen and PrismPOS, bringing
			product requirements through architecture, release, and production support.
		</p>
		<p class="text-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">When I'm not immersed in code, you'll often find me:</p>
		<ul class="text-md mb-8 list-inside list-disc leading-relaxed">
			<li>Sipping on a warm cup of Earl Grey tea</li>
			<li>Tinkering with Arduino-based hobby projects</li>
			<li>Taking refreshing swims in the nearby ocean</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="text-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">
			I enjoy the space between low-level systems work and practical software: understanding how
			things behave, then making them dependable for the people who use them. I write about parts of
			that process on this site.
		</p>

		<p>
			You can find my work on <a
				aria-label="github repository"
				class="cactus-link inline-block"
				href="https://github.com/itsyaasir"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank">GitHub</a
			> or <a class="cactus-link" href="mailto:yasir@shariff.dev">send me an email</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
